   259	## D2 — Seal re-base
   260	
   261	**Blast radius, enumerated honestly** (DP-r1-04 — r1 named three functions;
   262	the truth is every coordinate-resolution site on BOTH paths):
   263	
   264	*Construction:*
   265	- `_cursor_rowid(fact_id)` (`:1531-1545`) → `_cursor_ordinal`, selecting
